stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Absent
  Absent --> FinalPathOpened: O_CREAT|O_TRUNC
  FinalPathOpened --> HeaderWritten
  HeaderWritten --> PayloadWriting
  PayloadWriting --> FileClosed
  FileClosed --> HotRAM: map insert
  HotRAM --> WarmRAM: turn/byte demotion
  WarmRAM --> ColdSSD: turn/byte demotion
  ColdSSD --> HotRAM: load + promote
  ColdSSD --> Evicted: cold count pruning
  HotRAM --> Evicted: directory/cache eviction
  WarmRAM --> Evicted: directory/cache eviction
  Evicted --> [*]
  FinalPathOpened --> CrashVisiblePartial: crash
  HeaderWritten --> CrashVisiblePartial: crash
  PayloadWriting --> CrashVisiblePartial: crash
  CrashVisiblePartial --> IndexedHeaderOnly: restart scan may see full header
  IndexedHeaderOnly --> MissOnRead: short body
